WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.984
- What's up, Believe Nation, it's Evan,

00:00:01.984 --> 00:00:03.911
my one word is Believe,

00:00:03.911 --> 00:00:05.619
and I believe in people more
than they believe in themselves

00:00:05.619 --> 00:00:07.478
and my sincere hope is that

00:00:07.478 --> 00:00:10.310
if you see in you what I see in you,

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.410
you'll be able to change the planet.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.114
I'm excited to launch
a new potential series,

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.849
this is the first in the series,

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.369
called EntRoundup, where the idea is,

00:00:18.369 --> 00:00:20.139
so this is the concept,

00:00:20.139 --> 00:00:21.715
we take a clip from different

00:00:21.715 --> 00:00:22.743
entrepreneur-related channels,

00:00:22.743 --> 00:00:23.663
channels that I look up to,

00:00:23.663 --> 00:00:24.570
channels that inspire me,

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:26.368
some of the channels that
I'm paying attention to,

00:00:26.368 --> 00:00:28.103
and take one of their clips that I think

00:00:28.103 --> 00:00:30.310
is one of the best of from the past month,

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:32.220
and give you a snippet of it,

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.525
and mash them altogether,

00:00:33.525 --> 00:00:35.584
and it's kind of the best of the month.

00:00:35.584 --> 00:00:36.894
So if you're limited on time,

00:00:36.894 --> 00:00:39.389
and you don't want to
watch everybody's channel

00:00:39.389 --> 00:00:41.328
and everybody's video this
is kind of a sneak peak

00:00:41.328 --> 00:00:43.281
into the world of a couple of awesome

00:00:43.281 --> 00:00:44.546
entrepreneurial channels,

00:00:44.546 --> 00:00:46.211
and hopefully get
inspired to make a change

00:00:46.211 --> 00:00:47.932
in your business and in your life.

00:00:47.932 --> 00:00:49.602
So I'm looking forward
to launching the series,

00:00:49.602 --> 00:00:51.769
and hearing your thoughts.

